OL,4,B115 days, 39 private-jet flights, one  
OL,5,Belection - Infantino's globetrotting   
OL,6,GFifa president Gianni Infantino's      
OL,7,Gglobetrotting by private jet since his 
OL,8,Gplan to sell off a stake in the World  
OL,9,GCup can be revealed.                   
OL,11,FBBC Sport found Infantino has taken 39 
OL,12,Fprivate flights - the equivalent of    
OL,13,Fone every three days - and visited 32  
OL,14,Fdifferent countries since the news     
OL,15,Femerged on 28 July.                    
OL,17,FOur research found he travelled more   
OL,18,Fthan 102,800 air miles and spent just  
OL,19,Funder nine days in the air in the      
OL,20,Fspace of 115 days.                     
